          "explanation": "The doctor interpreted the named returned findings rather than only giving generic pneumonia advice.",
          "quote": "肺实变是影像上的描述"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor used workspace querying and the visible result words to discuss chlamydia, metapneumovirus, and consolidation in context, while still routing treatment decisions to the inpatient team.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
