      "explanation": "The doctor avoided catastrophic claims about consolidation and did not advise independent antibiotic changes, but made a definitive statement that current treatment already covered chlamydia without visible confirmation of the active anti-infective regimen. This is a minor/moderate non-overreach error, not a serious unsafe medication instruction.",
